<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">
<div style="text-align:start">
<div><span style="font-size:small"><span style="color:#222222"><span style="font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="font-variant-ligatures:normal"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="white-space:normal"><span style="background-color:#ffffff"><span style="text-decoration-thickness:initial"><span style="text-decoration-style:initial"><span style="text-decoration-color:initial"><span style="font-family:georgia, serif">Hi {{{Recipient.FirstName}}},&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div>

<div>&nbsp;</div>

<div><span style="font-size:small"><span style="color:#222222"><span style="font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="font-variant-ligatures:normal"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="white-space:normal"><span style="background-color:#ffffff"><span style="text-decoration-thickness:initial"><span style="text-decoration-style:initial"><span style="text-decoration-color:initial"><span style="font-family:georgia, serif">What if your leads&nbsp;<i>worked harder</i>&nbsp;for you - and you didn't have to hire extra staff or chase them down?&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div>

<div>&nbsp;</div>

<div><span style="font-size:small"><span style="color:#222222"><span style="font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="font-variant-ligatures:normal"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="white-space:normal"><span style="background-color:#ffffff"><span style="text-decoration-thickness:initial"><span style="text-decoration-style:initial"><span style="text-decoration-color:initial"><span style="font-family:georgia, serif">That's exactly what agents get when they combine&nbsp;<b>EverQuote's&nbsp;<wbr />Accelerated&nbsp;Growth Program (AGP)</b>&nbsp;with our&nbsp;<b>Lead Connection Program (LCS)</b>. It's a game-changing combo designed for serious&nbsp;growth.&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div>

<div>&nbsp;</div>

<div><span style="font-size:small"><span style="color:#222222"><span style="font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="font-variant-ligatures:normal"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="white-space:normal"><span style="background-color:#ffffff"><span style="text-decoration-thickness:initial"><span style="text-decoration-style:initial"><span style="text-decoration-color:initial"><span style="font-family:georgia, serif"><b>What agents love about AGP:</b>&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div>

<div>
<ul>
	<li style="margin-left:15px"><span style="font-size:small"><span style="color:#222222"><span style="font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="font-variant-ligatures:normal"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="white-space:normal"><span style="background-color:#ffffff"><span style="text-decoration-thickness:initial"><span style="text-decoration-style:initial"><span style="text-decoration-color:initial"><span style="font-family:georgia, serif"><b>Credit back</b>&nbsp;to your account every month - helping offset lead cost&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></li>
	<li style="margin-left:15px"><span style="font-size:small"><span style="color:#222222"><span style="font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="font-variant-ligatures:normal"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="white-space:normal"><span style="background-color:#ffffff"><span style="text-decoration-thickness:initial"><span style="text-decoration-style:initial"><span style="text-decoration-color:initial"><span style="font-family:georgia, serif">A&nbsp;<b>dedicated Agency Business Consultant&nbsp;</b>to boost performance and ROI</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></li>
	<li style="margin-left:15px"><span style="font-size:small"><span style="color:#222222"><span style="font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="font-variant-ligatures:normal"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="white-space:normal"><span style="background-color:#ffffff"><span style="text-decoration-thickness:initial"><span style="text-decoration-style:initial"><span style="text-decoration-color:initial"><span style="font-family:georgia, serif"><b>Exclusive access</b>&nbsp;to new products, tools &amp; filters&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></li>
	<li style="margin-left:15px"><span style="font-size:small"><span style="color:#222222"><span style="font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="font-variant-ligatures:normal"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="white-space:normal"><span style="background-color:#ffffff"><span style="text-decoration-thickness:initial"><span style="text-decoration-style:initial"><span style="text-decoration-color:initial"><span style="font-family:georgia, serif"><b>Lead return featur</b>e built into your dashboard</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></li>
</ul>

<div>&nbsp;</div>

<div><span style="font-size:small"><span style="color:#222222"><span style="font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="font-variant-ligatures:normal"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="white-space:normal"><span style="background-color:#ffffff"><span style="text-decoration-thickness:initial"><span style="text-decoration-style:initial"><span style="text-decoration-color:initial"><span style="font-family:georgia, serif">And with LCS, our. team calls your leads for you:&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div>
</div>

<ul>
	<li style="margin-left:15px"><span style="font-size:small"><span style="color:#222222"><span style="font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="font-variant-ligatures:normal"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="white-space:normal"><span style="background-color:#ffffff"><span style="text-decoration-thickness:initial"><span style="text-decoration-style:initial"><span style="text-decoration-color:initial"><span class="gmail_default" style="font-family:georgia, serif">We connect prospects within 30 seconds</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></li>
	<li style="margin-left:15px"><span style="font-size:small"><span style="color:#222222"><span style="font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="font-variant-ligatures:normal"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="white-space:normal"><span style="background-color:#ffffff"><span style="text-decoration-thickness:initial"><span style="text-decoration-style:initial"><span style="text-decoration-color:initial"><span class="gmail_default" style="font-family:georgia, serif">Follow up for&nbsp;<i>7 days&nbsp;</i>- so no opportunity is wasted&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></li>
	<li style="margin-left:15px"><span style="font-size:small"><span style="color:#222222"><span style="font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="font-variant-ligatures:normal"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="white-space:normal"><span style="background-color:#ffffff"><span style="text-decoration-thickness:initial"><span style="text-decoration-style:initial"><span style="text-decoration-color:initial"><span class="gmail_default" style="font-family:georgia, serif">You only talk to&nbsp;<b>live shoppers</b>, ready for a quote&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></li>
	<li style="margin-left:15px"><span style="font-size:small"><span style="color:#222222"><span style="font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="font-variant-ligatures:normal"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="white-space:normal"><span style="background-color:#ffffff"><span style="text-decoration-thickness:initial"><span style="text-decoration-style:initial"><span style="text-decoration-color:initial"><span class="gmail_default" style="font-family:georgia, serif">You still get&nbsp;<b>full info</b>&nbsp;on every lead&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></li>
</ul>

<div>&nbsp;</div>

<div><span style="font-size:small"><span style="color:#222222"><span style="font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="font-variant-ligatures:normal"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="white-space:normal"><span style="background-color:#ffffff"><span style="text-decoration-thickness:initial"><span style="text-decoration-style:initial"><span style="text-decoration-color:initial"><font face="georgia, serif">One agent put it best:&nbsp;</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div>
</div>

<div style="text-align:start">
<blockquote style="border:none; padding:0px; margin-left:40px">
<div>
<div><span style="font-size:small"><span style="color:#222222"><span style="font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="font-variant-ligatures:normal"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="white-space:normal"><span style="background-color:#ffffff"><span style="text-decoration-thickness:initial"><span style="text-decoration-style:initial"><span style="text-decoration-color:initial"><span style="font-family:georgia, serif">"50%-70% of our total sales comes from LCS. It's been a total game-changer."</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div>
</div>
</blockquote>

<div>&nbsp;</div>

<p><span style="font-size:small"><span style="color:#222222"><span style="font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="font-variant-ligatures:normal"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="white-space:normal"><span style="background-color:#ffffff"><span style="text-decoration-thickness:initial"><span style="text-decoration-style:initial"><span style="text-decoration-color:initial"><font face="georgia, serif">Ready to unlock this kind of growth?&nbsp;</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>

<p><span style="font-size:small"><span style="color:#222222"><span style="font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="font-variant-ligatures:normal"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="white-space:normal"><span style="background-color:#ffffff"><span style="text-decoration-thickness:initial"><span style="text-decoration-style:initial"><span style="text-decoration-color:initial"><font face="georgia, serif">Book time with me here: {{{Sender.Calendar_Link__c}}}</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
</div>

